  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, <math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math> ......(i)<br /><br />Where, <math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Comparing the coefficients M, L, T, of both sides we get<br /><br /><math><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> ......(ii)<br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ......(iii)<br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> .....(iv)<br /><br />Solve the equations (ii), (iii) and (iv), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />So, <math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math>"
